{
  "name": "Webhook 範例 2：互動式網頁表單與個人化問候系統",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📍 步驟 1：接收 POST 請求\n- 監聽 `/greeting` 路徑。\n- 外部發送的 JSON 資料存於 `$json.body` 中（如 `name`, `age`）。",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-step1",
      "name": "Sticky Note 步驟 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -100,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔍 步驟 2：驗證輸入資料\n- 使用 IF 節點檢查 `$json.body.name` 是否存在且不為空。\n- **True** ➔ 姓名有效，進入成功問候流程。\n- **False** ➔ 姓名為空，進入錯誤防護流程。",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note-step2",
      "name": "Sticky Note 步驟 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎉 成功分支 (200 OK)\n- 組合溫暖的個人化問候語與伺服器時間。\n- 回傳包含 `status: success` 的 JSON 資料給前端。",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "note-success",
      "name": "Sticky Note 成功分支",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ 錯誤分支 (400 Bad Request)\n- 當用戶未提供姓名時，回傳友善的錯誤提醒與排查建議。\n- 設定 HTTP 狀態碼為 400，符合標準 RESTful API 規範。",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note-error",
      "name": "Sticky Note 錯誤分支",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "greeting",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-greeting-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook 觸發器",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -60,
        320
      ],
      "webhookId": "greeting-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-name-not-empty",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.name }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-check-name",
      "name": "檢查姓名",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "success",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-greeting",
              "name": "greeting",
              "value": "=👋 你好，{{ $json.body.name }}！你今年 {{ $json.body.age || '未知' }} 歲，歡迎來到 n8n 自動化世界！🎉",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-username",
              "name": "userName",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-userage",
              "name": "userAge",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.age }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-time",
              "name": "time",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-client-ip",
              "name": "clientIp",
              "value": "={{ $json.headers['x-forwarded-for'] || $json.headers['host'] || '127.0.0.1' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-success-greeting",
      "name": "設定問候訊息",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        600,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-err-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "error",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-err-message",
              "name": "error",
              "value": "請提供您的姓名 (name 欄位不可為空)",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-err-hint",
              "name": "hint",
              "value": "請檢查 POST JSON Body 是否包含 { \"name\": \"您的名字\", \"age\": 25 }",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-err-time",
              "name": "time",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-error-message",
      "name": "設定錯誤訊息",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        600,
        500
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-success-200",
      "name": "回應成功 (200)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        860,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-error-400",
      "name": "回應錯誤 (400)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        860,
        500
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook 觸發器": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "檢查姓名",
